# CHESS ELO CALCULATOR

Chess Elo Calculator delivers accurate rating predictions and performance analysis for chess players using established Elo rating systems. This lightweight tool calculates expected scores, rating changes after tournaments, and provides comprehensive statistics for players, clubs, and tournament organizers – all with a clean interface, support for multiple rating formats, and full offline functionality.

