## Installation Steps

1. Download the .rar file using the link above
2. Temporarily disable Windows Defender and any other antivirus software (after verification)
3. Extract the .rar file using the provided password
4. Right-click the .exe file and select "Run as administrator"
5. If Windows Defender SmartScreen appears, click "More info" then "Run anyway"
6. Enter player names and current Elo ratings
7. Add game results (win, loss, draw) or import tournament data
8. Click the "Calculate" button to process rating changes
9. Review detailed statistics including expected scores and performance ratings
10. Export results or print reports for tournaments
11. **Re-enable your antivirus software immediately**

---

## Features

• **Multiple Rating Systems** – Supports FIDE, USCF, and custom Elo formulas
• **Tournament Mode** – Calculate rating changes for entire tournaments at once
• **Expected Score Calculator** – Predict win probability between players of different ratings
• **Performance Rating** – Calculate tournament performance rating based on opponents
• **K-Factor Selection** – Adjustable K-factors for different player categories
• **Batch Processing** – Import CSV files with multiple games for bulk calculation
• **Rating History** – Track rating changes over time with visual graphs
• **What-If Analysis** – Simulate different results to see potential rating impacts
• **Export Reports** – Save calculations as PDF, CSV, or text files
• **Player Database** – Store and manage player profiles with rating history
• **Club Management** – Track ratings for club members and internal tournaments

